# Ignore all data files but keep the folder structure.
*
!.gitignore
!raw/
!processed/
raw/*
processed/*
!raw/.gitkeep
!processed/.gitkeep
!raw/finqa/
!raw/finqa/*.json
!processed/*.jsonl

# Experiment outputs the report cites. Small (~5 MB total) and they're the evidence
# behind every number in docs/REPORT.md, so they belong in git.
# Note the directory itself has to be re-included first — git won't look inside a
# folder excluded by the `*` on line 2.
!runs/
runs/*
!runs/*.jsonl

# ...except these two. (Comments must be on their own line — a trailing "#" is
# treated as part of the pattern, not a comment.)
# 5-row smoke test, not cited anywhere:
runs/judge_sanity.jsonl
# byte-identical copy of judge_v1_original_prompt.jsonl:
runs/judge_detection_eval.jsonl
